OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by car in
OL,4,AFife village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 51-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car on the A92 in Fife.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,Fincident involving a red Suzuki Swift
OL,11,Fin Freuchie at about 23:50 on Thursday.
OL,13,FThe pedestrian was pronounced dead at
OL,14,Fthe scene and the female driver was
OL,15,Funinjured.
OL,17,FPolice closed the road to carry out an
OL,18,Finvestigation and it reopened about
OL,19,F05:50 on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
